{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 6,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.4136962890625,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "Although global guidance on interventions to address TB and key comorbidities exists in different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4155883789062,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "publications, its uptake has been variable. The  WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.4295043945312,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "consolidate the latest evidence-based recommendations  Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.3915405273438,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and provide a one-stop shop for countries to scale up people-centred care and prevention of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4277954101562,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "TB and comorbidities. They include the latest recommendations developed by various guideline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.415771484375,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "development groups (GDGs) convened by WHO, which used the Grading of Recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4177856445312,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Assessment, Development and Evaluation (GRADE) approach to summarize the evidence and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.384765625,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "formulate recommendations (see Annex 1 for the current approach). The GRADE approach was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.38916015625,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "used to rate the certainty in the estimate of effect (that is, the quality of evidence) as high, moderate,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.3870849609375,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "low or very low; it was also used to determine the strength of the recommendations, rating them as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4486694335938,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "strong or conditional. The GDGs used the version of the WHO Handbook for guideline development",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        435.8561096191406,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "that applied at the time. For more details, please refer to the original guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.421875,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "These guidelines are accompanied by an operational handbook   and are aligned with WHO’s  (7)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4072875976562,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": ". The consolidated guidelines  Framework for collaborative action on tuberculosis and comorbidities (2)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4222412109375,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "summarize WHO recommendations on TB and comorbidities and the evidence and processes behind",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4122924804688,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "them, while the operational handbook provides practical guidance to aid in the implementation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4354248046875,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "these recommendations by country programmes. The Framework document provides a structure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4102172851562,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and mechanisms for establishing and strengthening collaborative action across disease programmes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.443115234375,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and with relevant sectors outside the health system for the delivery of people-centred care for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4332885742188,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB and comorbidities. To further strengthen a comprehensive response to TB and comorbidities,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4321899414062,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "it is critical to ensure linkages with the national coordination platforms and mechanisms for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        341.18609619140625,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Multisectoral accountability framework for TB (MAF-TB)  . (8)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.2184143066406,
        127.3284912109375,
        437.87841796875
      ],
      "text": "Objectives",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        311.99822998046875,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The objectives of the consolidated guidelines are to:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        451.3824157714844,
        422.6832580566406,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "consolidate existing recommendations to address TB and comorbidities;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4439697265625,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "support Member States in implementing effective people-centred interventions to address TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4515991210938,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and comorbidities and contribute to reducing disease burden, morbidity and mortality, as well",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        493.3824157714844,
        460.56622314453125,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "as costs and financial hardship for people affected by TB and comorbidities; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        78.23609924316406,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        507.3824462890625,
        398.199462890625,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "contribute to reducing the disease burden of TB and comorbidities.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.2184448242188,
        202.2037353515625,
        563.8784790039062
      ],
      "text": "Structure and evolution",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4410400390625,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The consolidated guidelines are a living document and will include a separate section for each of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4213256835938,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "key TB comorbidities or health-related risk factors. The first edition of the consolidated guidelines on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4114379882812,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "TB comorbidities focuses entirely on HIV-associated TB. In the second edition a section on nutrition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        444.9981689453125,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "will be added. Content for each section will be progressively updated and added.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        364.234375,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
